    <description>This screen flow is triggered via the &quot;Send Acknowledgment Email&quot; button on a Gift Transaction list view. Users should select records from the Gift Transaction list view, then click the button. This flow launches, prompts the user to select and Acknowledgment email template, sends the email to the donors, then marks the Acknowledgment Date and Acknowledgment Status fields on the Gift Transaction. Also, the email is logged on the Gift Transaction&apos;s activity timeline. [Arkus/BL 4-2-25]
[Arkus/BL 4-8-25] Updated links on screens to point to GT List view in NPC Prod.
[DJS/11-14-25] Can now include acknowledgements for Gala and Corporate Match</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>If Donor on the GT is a person account, then use the Contact ID related to the Donor ID. If the Donor of the GT is an Organizaiton Account, then use the &quot;Acknowledgement Recipient&quot; on the Donor Account (which is a person account).</description>
        <name>f_RecipientID</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!Loop_through_GTs.Donor.IsPersonAccount} = True, {!Loop_through_GTs.Donor.PersonContactId}, 
{!Loop_through_GTs.Donor.Acknowledgment_Recipient__r.Id}
)</expression>
    </formulas>
